/**
 * EduTrack Pro — development seed.
 *
 * Creates a realistic Kenyan Junior School (Grades 7–9) dataset:
 * school profile + calendar, learning areas/strands, classes and learners,
 * teacher assignments and availability, assessments with published results,
 * learning resources (including a real uploaded PDF), assignments, a generated
 * and published timetable with a full audit trail, plus notifications.
 *
 * Safety rules honoured by this file:
 *  * No real learner data — every name, assessment number and phone number here
 *    is synthetic and clearly fictional.
 *  * No hard-coded passwords: passwords come from environment variables or are
 *    randomly generated and printed once at the end of the run.
 *  * No public default credentials ship with the repository.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   npm run seed                 # full demo dataset (recreates the demo school)
 *   npm run seed -- --keep       # keep existing demo school, add nothing twice
 */
